---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About | MockAgent.AI"
  description="How MockAgent.AI researches and reviews AI tools for independent insurance agents."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h1>About MockAgent.AI</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Field-reviewed research for independent agents navigating the AI tool landscape.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>
        MockAgent.AI publishes practical guides to AI tools for independent P&C and life/health insurance agents 
        in the United States. We focus on software that agents actually use: lead qualification, comparative rating, 
        CRM and renewal automation, claims and FNOL support, and customer service.
      </p>

      <h2>How we evaluate tools</h2>
      <p>
        Our comparisons are based on publicly available documentation, vendor materials, pricing pages, and aggregated 
        user feedback from review sites such as G2, Capterra, and TrustRadius. We do not claim to have hands-on tested 
        every feature of every product unless that is explicitly stated in the article.
      </p>
      <p>
        When we recommend a tool, we explain the trade-off. When a category has no clear winner, we say so. We do not 
        accept payment for placement, and any future affiliate or sponsored relationship will be disclosed clearly on 
        the relevant page.
      </p>

      <h2>AI-assistance disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some content on this site is drafted with the assistance of AI writing tools and then reviewed, fact-checked, 
        and edited by a human editor before publication. We verify pricing, feature claims, and regulatory references 
        against primary sources where possible, but you should always confirm details with the vendor or your state 
        Department of Insurance before making a purchase or compliance decision.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        MockAgent.AI is run by an independent research desk. We are not insurance agents, brokers, or licensed 
        professionals, and we do not provide legal, compliance, or insurance advice. Our value is in organizing and 
        explaining a crowded software market so you can make faster, better-informed decisions.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, corrections, or partnership inquiries? <a href="/contact">Reach out here</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    background-color: var(--white);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .page-lead {
    color: var(--slate-gray);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }
</style>
